<title>USA: CONSENSUS: U.S. corporate earnings surprise data.</title>
<headline>CONSENSUS: U.S. corporate earnings surprise data.</headline>
<text>
<p>Earnings surprise for March 25, provided by Zacks Investment Research. The following companies reported the greatest deviations, above or below analysts' mean estimates, as compiled by Zacks.</p>
<p>COMPANY		   ESTIMATE  ACTUAL  PCT SURPRISE</p>
<p>NOVATEL INC	     0.03     0.04*     33.33%</p>
<p>STRIDE RITE CORP	0.06     0.08	33.33%</p>
<p>MORRISON KNUDSN	 0.10     0.13	30.00%</p>
<p>BRYLANE INC	     0.47     0.54	14.89%</p>
<p>MAZEL STORES	    0.22     0.25	13.64%</p>
<p>TALBOTS INC	     0.47     0.50	 6.38%</p>
<p>SIMULA INC	     -0.08    -0.51    -537.50%</p>
<p>STOLT COMEX SWY	-0.10    -0.25    -150.00%</p>
<p>COLE NATL NEW	   0.82     0.79*     -3.66%</p>
<p>(*)NOTE ADJUSTMENTS:</p>
<p>- Cole Natl New reported EPS adjusted to exclude $3.72 charge related to acquisition.</p>
<p>- Novatel Inc said U.S. dollar exchange rate was 0.7379.</p>
</text>
